{"title": "Conjure Minor Elemental", "pageid": 7998, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 4 Spells", "Conjuration spells", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Actions", "Sources of Slashing damage", "Sources of Bludgeoning damage", "Sources of Fire damage", "Sources of Cold damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the level 4 conjuration spell. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Conjure Elemental (disambiguation)\">Conjure Elemental (disambiguation)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp/300px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp, /w/images/6/6c/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp/300px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Conjure Minor Elemental </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 4 conjuration spell</a>. It conjures 2 Mud Mephits, 2 Ice Mephits, or an Azer to fight for you.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nConjure a minor elemental to fight alongside you.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_ConjureElementals_Minor_Container</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_ConjureElementals_Minor_Container\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_ConjureElementals_Minor_Container\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetCharacter_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetCharacter (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetCharacter</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Azer\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Azer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/60px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/80px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Azer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Azer\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Azer\">Conjure Minor Elemental: Azer</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Ice_Mephits\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Ice Mephits\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp/60px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp/80px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Ice Mephits\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Ice_Mephits\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Ice Mephits\">Conjure Minor Elemental: Ice Mephits</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Mud_Mephits\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Mud Mephits\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp/60px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp/80px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Mud Mephits\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Mud_Mephits\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Mud Mephits\">Conjure Minor Elemental: Mud Mephits</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 7: <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Land\" title=\"Circle of the Land\">Circle of the Land</a> (Arctic and Forest)</li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental\" title=\"Scroll of Conjure Minor Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Conjure_Minor_Elemental\" title=\"Scroll of Conjure Minor Elemental\">Scroll of Conjure Minor Elemental</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Each caster is only able to have one instance of this active at a time, no matter which version is chosen. Casting it a second time despawns the current elemental(s), and activates their Death Burst.</li>\n<li>This spell is considered independent of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/20px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/30px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp/20px-Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Conjure_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Elemental\">Conjure Elemental</a>; each caster can have one instance of Elemental and Minor Elemental active simultaneously.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/0/06/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\"